  She drops her head. I can't tell if this is meant to be a bow or an evasion. Either way, I can only see the tops of her ears. They resemble nothing more than two ripe cherries.

  ...Now㉒<I>I'm</I>㉓getting uncomfortable.

  She likes it. That's what matters. I lean forward.

